    "lead_paragraphs": [
      "On the beach of Barcelona , you can find a lot of chiringuitos, bars and restaurants serving delicious food and refreshing drinks . Chiringuitos are especially popular on the beach, as they are small beach restaurants. In addition to the beach bars , Barcelona beach also has a large number of high quality restaurants offering a wide variety of local and international dishes. Some of them offer a more refined and quality dining experience. The beach restaurants in Barcelona are very varied and offer a wide range of options for all tastes and budgets .",
      "You can also consult our proposal of Michelin star restaurants in Barcelona for less than 50€. or the best tasting menus to give as a gift, or our proposal on five clandestine dinners in Barcelona that will not leave you indifferent. .",
      "Bestial Beach Club is one of the most famous and popular beach bars in Barcelona . It is located on the Barceloneta beach, right on the seafront, and has a large terrace overlooking the sea ."
